  "heading": "Provision for dependants of prisoner war from his pay and allowances.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 99,
  "text": "It shall be lawful for proper provision to be made by the prescribed authorities for any dependants of any person subject to this Act who is a prisoner of war or is missing, out of his pay and allowances.",
